                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2766604,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "On a more local scale, this new technology could help with the cleanup of environmental disasters as nanotechnology will allow us to remove oil and other contaminants from the water far more effectively.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 320.73,
                  "from": 307.05,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2766638,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And if nanotechnology progresses as expected, as a sort of building block set of about 90 atoms, then you could build anything you wanted from the bottom up.",
