            "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Uses of Nanotechnology</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Transport</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Nanotechnology could allow the development of stronger <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Planes would be much lighter in weight.</p>\n<p><strong>●&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> travel will be made available to the masses.</p>\n<p><strong>Technology</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Computers will be even smaller, faster, and will have a greater <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>●&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span> Energy will become more affordable.</p>\n<p><strong>The Environment</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Nano-robots could rebuild the ozone layer.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Pollutants such as <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> could be removed from water</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;There will be no <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span> from manufacturing.</p>\n<p><strong>Health and Medicine</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;New methods of food production could eradicate famine.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Analysis of medical <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> will be speeded up.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Life expectancy could be increased.</p>",
